OL,3,GNEWSAParking enforcement stepped up    
OL,4,Anear airport                           
OL,6,FEnforcement is being increased to stop 
OL,7,Fpeople parking in unauthorised areas   
OL,8,Fnear an airport.                       
OL,10,FResidents told the BBC in June they    
OL,11,Fwere "suffering immeasurably" because  
OL,12,Fof the rise of unauthorised car parks  
OL,13,Fclose to Bristol Airport.              
OL,15,FA parking planning enforcement officer 
OL,16,Fhas operated in the area since 2024,   
OL,17,Fand the airport is now funding another 
OL,18,Fofficer in the hope it will "protect   
OL,19,Flocal communities, preserve the green  
OL,20,Fbelt and support travellers using      
OL,21,Flegitimate parking providers," said    
OL,22,FNorth Somerset Council.                
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
