OL,3,GNEWSAParking enforcement stepped up    
OL,4,Anear airport                           
OL,6,FCouncillor Annemieke Waite said:       
OL,7,F"Residents quite rightly expect us to  
OL,8,Ftake action on the impacts of airport  
OL,9,Fparking, and while there is still more 
OL,10,Fwork to do, we are making progress.    
